{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-1c36c534efa38d9e64fe","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","text":"시계 소년이 널 도와줄게, 째깍! 내 친구들에 대해 한번 들어볼래, 째깍?","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"기쁨","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11092996198249004331","5271158942322051489"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-ec2ddf1639ea017403f7","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","text":"하누 형제, 가장 든든한 형님이야, 째깍! 나와 소다수 씨를 데리고 시계 식당에 가서 맛있는 것도 먹고, 극장 콘서트에도 초대해 줬지, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"기쁨","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3807029232181855559","2386543721241290891"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-0ee739fe4a79a8cc58e3","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","text":"난 그렇게 고상한 건 잘 몰라서 도중에 자버렸지만 말이야, 하하! 그래도 정말 즐거웠어, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"기쁨","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7063822173577978502","222008166021640078"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-5b2f9ee5b37724f8ef3f","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","text":"소다수 씨는 나의 좋은 친구야, 째깍! 부지런하고 똑똑한 데다 착하기까지 하지. 날 위해 매번 팔고 남은 패스트푸드를 남겨주는데 돈도 안 받아, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"기쁨","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10956499636871387401","1636073267699898521"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-86c0c31e31c033e59eca","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","text":"그들과 친구가 될 수 있어서 정말 다행이야, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"기쁨","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16988751984347176910","1542095742563048108"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-884ad68f3f7d9517dcbd","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","text":"다른 친구들도 많은데, 다 좋은 녀석들이야…. 기회가 된다면 또 제대로 소개해 줄게!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"기쁨","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["985503594089831015","15058865277670809580"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-38b4e616623c909deda8","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s1e79932084c429e1","text":"그들은 영원히 내 최고의 친구야, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"기쁨","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15342971811408804842"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p11525","title":"「시계 소년」","page":"「钟表小子」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-1c36c534efa38d9e64fe","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-1c36c534efa38d9e64fe","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s1e79932084c429e1","scene":"기쁨","contextId":"wiki-context-4ed478f0e55311e0104bdab9","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-npc-p11525-ec2ddf1639ea017403f7"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-ec2ddf1639ea017403f7","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-ec2ddf1639ea017403f7","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s1e79932084c429e1","scene":"기쁨","contextId":"wiki-context-4ed478f0e55311e0104bdab9","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[0,1],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["